e that lets you see exactly who's cold and who's still able to pull a trigger.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 19, "name": "Horror"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/postal", "videos": [{"id": 109872, "name": "Gameplay Video", "video_id": "BO-i7aHBxwU", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BO-i7aHBxwU", "title": "POSTAL 1 - Level 1", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/BO-i7aHBxwU/hqdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 110328, "name": "Dev Diary", "video_id": "_Nut58ZhW_w", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_Nut58ZhW_w", "title": "POSTAL 1 Beta - 1997 Developer Demonstration", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/_Nut58ZhW_w/maxresdefault.jpg"}], "collections": [{"id": 371, "name": "Postal"}]}